### B32 bit patterns of i - 8 for 0 <= i <= 20, the base-2 logarithm of the power of 2 taken out of 1 + x.
preset CM_BF16_LOG2P1_R0: @Array[U32, 21] <- [0xC1000000, 0xC0E00000, 0xC0C00000, 0xC0A00000, 0xC0800000, 0xC0400000,
    0xC0000000, 0xBF800000, 0x80000000, 0x3F800000, 0x40000000, 0x40400000, 0x40800000, 0x40A00000, 0x40C00000,
    0x40E00000, 0x41000000, 0x41100000, 0x41200000, 0x41300000, 0x41400000]

### Pairs of B32 bit patterns {r, -log2(r)} (flattened) for 0 <= i < 64, where r approximates 1/(1 + i/64).
